{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 RefLab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Mix / reference comparison inside REAPER, as a JSFX (works with portable REAPER).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 4 references, loaded from {\f1 <REAPER>/Data/references}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mix and reference spectrums overlaid, difference curve, adjustable measuring speed\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Band solo (5 bands, ISOL8 style) and monitoring modes stereo / mono / side / L / R\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Momentary / short-term / integrated LUFS (BS.1770), automatic loudness match\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab One loop per reference (drag on the waveform)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab References remembered per project (with the Todoroki Companion)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Every setting can be mapped to MIDI (Param > Learn) or to the "Todoroki_RefLab ..." actions\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Put it in the Monitoring FX. The {\b Todoroki Companion} package adds opening the references folder, live refresh of the file list and the per-project memory.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 RS Trig Sampler\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Drum replacement sampler in JSFX (portable REAPER friendly), meant to sit after a trigger (MIDI) tool. One instance = one drum element, up to 8 samples played in parallel.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 8 slots, each with multi-velocity / round-robin kits (.rsk.wav) or plain audio files\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Per slot: volume, pan, pitch, attack / hold / decay / curve, velocity target + sensitivity, voices, round robin cycle / random, choke groups, 8 stereo outputs, mute / solo\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Samples are stored in the project and in REAPER presets (one preset = a full layered kit)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Library in {\f1 <REAPER>/Data/RSampler}, filled by the {\b RS Trig Kit Builder} script (Slate Trigger 2 .tci import, WAV folders, auto-organised by element / instrument)\sa180\par}
}

